 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- `install-ff.py`, a user-space manager in the OSAT Fluent shape: versioned snapshot and venv under `~/.local/share/file-fairy/<version>/`, `ff` and `file-fairy` wrappers in `~/.local/bin` (Windows: `%LOCALAPPDATA%`), with `--install`, `--switch`, `--status`, `--remove` and `--version`. Resolves the invocation-friction roadmap item.
+
+### Changed
+
+- `pyproject.toml` reads its version from `VERSION` instead of a hard-coded `0.1.0`.
+- README Install section rewritten around `install-ff.py`.
+
